## 📲 SHAREit for Mac

SHAREit for Mac is a file-sharing and transfer utility designed to move photos, videos, music, documents and other supported files between compatible devices. Its cross-platform approach makes it useful when transferring content between a Mac and mobile devices without relying on traditional cable-based workflows.

The Mac version is available for compatible Apple Silicon Macs, while SHAREit's broader ecosystem supports Android, iOS, Windows and macOS.

